    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm doing some research for my ir class. i was looking at the TPP and i'm trying to figure out if it actually ended up being a win for the working class in the US or if it just helped big corporations more? like de facto, did it help or hurt regular people?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
